            "notes": "**POWER 2:**\n\n[Cosmic Coolant](item_5584169d-94af-4efa-955c-263353a75553) is mandatory as it will greatly reduce the cooldown of Pulsar Torpedos. Its effect applies to both enemies and allies.\n\n**ITEMS:**\n\n[Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) may be the strongest item you can get on Juno. With the amount of torpedoes she sends out with this build, it's uptime is almost constant. Making it essential to take early.\n\n[Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8) can be taken if you need more support or are just short on cash to buy [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505).\n\n**Extra Cash, or if you can't afford this round**\n\nAgain, take items like [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418), or stronger, that will further boost AP.",
